## API Integration Preparation

### Future API Endpoints (예상)
```
GET    /api/tickets
POST   /api/tickets
PUT    /api/tickets/:id
DELETE /api/tickets/:id
GET    /api/tickets/by-unique-code/:id

GET    /api/schedules  
POST   /api/schedules
PUT    /api/schedules/:id
DELETE /api/schedules/:id
```

### Type Safety
- API response 타입과 mock 데이터 타입 일치 유지
- 런타임 데이터 검증 준비

